site/public
# Documentation trees stay in the build context because the Rails suite
# validates same-repository source links (guides, features, maintainers and
# the evidence they cite) against real files. Publication is decided by the
# guides/features allowlists in site/config and MarkdownGuide, never by
# filesystem presence, so these docs remain non-public as routes.
site/docs/_site
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
site/config/master.key
